528
00:20:30,410 --> 00:20:31,320
Help the rest of the class.

529
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:31,812
Oh, thanks.

530
00:20:31,812 --> 00:20:34,887
AUDIENCE: You think you're on a hot streak just because you

531
00:20:34,887 --> 00:20:36,240
