00:20:38,536 --> 00:20:41,652
they're just overconfident in their shots, since they are

534
00:20:41,652 --> 00:20:45,550
shooting more shots in the end.

535
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:45,641
PROFESSOR: So people have a saying --

536
00:20:45,641 --> 00:20:47,920
If you watch a basketball game, it's incredibly how

