539
00:20:53,370 --> 00:20:54,350
They're so hot.

540
00:20:54,350 --> 00:20:55,570
Pass that ball to that person.

541
00:20:55,570 --> 00:20:56,600
They're so hot.

542
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:57,510
They shoot a three-pointer.

543
00:20:57,510 --> 00:20:58,540
And they come down and they shoot a three-pointer.

544
00:20:58,540 --> 00:20:59,970
And they say, why are you passing the

545
00:20:59,970 --> 00:21:00,620
ball to that person?

546
00:21:00,620 --> 00:21:03,100
They're so hot.

547
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:06,610
And some players are known as streaky players, who go out

548
00:21:06,610 --> 00:21:09,160
and have just awesome nights.

549
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,650
You hear this in the sports all the time.

550
00:21:10,650 --> 00:21:12,790
I can't tell you, the end of a close March Madness game,

