00:25:20,280 --> 00:25:22,590
There's an intuition that we have about things, heuristics,

661
00:25:22,590 --> 00:25:24,700
a feeling we have about things.

662
00:25:24,700 --> 00:25:28,370
Like the odds of this are almost nil.

663
00:25:28,370 --> 00:25:30,590
And we go by that feeling, instead of by being the

664
00:25:30,590 --> 00:25:36,790
rational analyst that we might be.

665
00:25:36,790 --> 00:25:37,160
Here's one.

